       needleAngle: number;
       isFacingTarget: boolean;
       distanceMeters: number;
       targetName?: string;
       per
<truncated 2523 bytes>
t/food-compass/src/services/evaluatorService.ts)**:
   - Added the typed `EateryCandidate` and `TextGenerationFunction` interfaces instead of `any[]` and `any`.

4. **In [osmServices.ts](file:///C:/Users/Chin%20Shi%20Er/Documents/Project/Hacktoberfest/food-compass/src/services/osmServices.ts)**:
   - Added typed `OverpassElement` and `OverpassResponse` interfaces.

5. **In [soundFeedback.ts](file:///C:/Users/Chin%20Shi%20Er/Documents/Project/Hacktoberfest/food-compass/src/services/soundFeedback.ts)**:
   - Added `interface WebKitWindow extends Window { webkitAudioContext?: typeof AudioContext; }`.

---

### 6. `'env.backends.onnx.wasm' is possibly 'undefined'`
* **Why it happened**: In `@huggingface/transformers`, the nested `env.backends?.onnx?.wasm` structure can be undefined depending on the active backend and build targets.
* **The Fix** in [evaluatorService.ts](file:///C:/Users/Chin%20Shi%20Er/Documents/Project/Hacktoberfest/food-compass/src/services/evaluatorService.ts):
