  if (env.backends?.onnx?.wasm) {
    env.backends.onnx.wasm.numThreads = 2;
  }
  ```

---

### 7. App Wiring & Mobile Tailwind Integration
- Installed and configured `@tailwindcss/vite` in [vite.config.ts](file:///C:/Users/Chin%20Shi%20Er/Documents/Project/Hacktoberfest/food-compass/vite.config.ts) and [index.css](file:///C:/Users/Chin%20Shi%20Er/Documents/Project/Hacktoberfest/food-compass/src/index.css).
